VulkanTransport
GPU diffuse patch transport baseline using VulkanEngine only.
build.c builds the VulkanTransport static library.

transport::patch - surface center, area, normal, albedo, emission
transport::blocker - axis-aligned visibility obstacle
transport::init(patches, blockers, shaders)
transport::record_build(command) - construct dense GPU patch exchange weights
transport::record_solve(command, even_iterations) - Jacobi multiple-bounce radiosity
transport::update_emission(index, value) - change light after GPU synchronization
transport::radiance_descriptor() - GPU buffer for consumer renderer
transport::shutdown()

Compile transport.comp twice with glslangValidator -V:
-DTRANSPORT_BUILD for exchange weights
-DTRANSPORT_SOLVE for Jacobi solve (default branch)

Limitations: O(N^2) memory/work, approximate differential form factors,
diffuse-only, static geometry until record_build, no sparse residual scheduling.
Not a completed Causal Radiance Graph or proven real-time GI breakthrough.
